                {
                    "action": "Go back",
                    "state": "explore-2"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "secret-compartment",
            "title": "The Engineer's Stash",
            "description": "Inside the panel revealed by the puzzle, you find a diagram of the facility. It explains that the 'Darkness' is actually a security system, and the Stone is a user-key. You feel much more confident now.",
